      "description": "TALIS is an onchain structured markets protocol built for tokenized stocks on Robinhood Chain.\n\nTALIS lets the same underlying asset serve two different market views. Holders can earn premium by giving up a defined portion of their future upside, while traders with stronger conviction can buy concentrated exposure to that upside.\n\nEach market operates through defined periods with transparent pricing, strike levels and onchain settlement. Instead of relying on traditional perpetual leverage, funding rates or liquidation mechanics, upside positions are backed by the underlying assets locked within the protocol.\n\nFor holders, TALIS creates a way to generate income from assets they already own. For traders, it creates a way to isolate and trade the part of a market move they actually want.\n\nOne asset. Different outcomes.\n\n100% of protocol revenue buys back $TALIS.\n\nBuilt on Robinhood Chain.\n$TALIS / ETH",
